WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.850
[Muusig diirran oo biyaano iyo koox qalab-muusig ah]

00:00.850 --> 00:02.318
Wuxuu imanayaa dayrtan.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.796
Wuxuu og yahay sida wanaagsan ee ay u dhaqmeen.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.542
Wuxuu yaqaan liiska rabitaankooda.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.160
Magacooda ayuu yaqaan.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.236
Santa u arag si gebi ahaan cusub.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
[Dhawaaq jilicsan. Gambaleellada gaadhiga barafka.]
